<title>FINLAND: Orion Jan-April profit falls 3.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Orion Jan-April profit falls 3.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     297 vs 307</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.87 vs 4.05</p>
<p> Net sales					  1,569 vs 1,490</p>
<p> Operating profit				   257 vs 256</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 11 analysts' forecasts for Finnish pharmaceuticals maker Orion-yhtyma Oy's profit before extras, tax had been 275 million markka in a 220-329 million range.</p>
</text>
